From 2f1a14521b1006e78ec860268e28e858bb473531 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: crossainthero <billymillena@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 13:52:57 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] sarness: bordered composer with the
 model/effort/server/permission line, SARNESS wordmark

- composer: full-width rules above and below, a marker, no filled panel
- persistent info line under it: model, effort, server, permission mode (agent muted)
- home: wordmark top-left, composer at the bottom; exit screen and run splash use the Sarness mark
- the launch effort starts each new session until the user picks a variant
